 *
 * Its own component because it is 16 brand marks written out twice — once to scroll off
 * the left and once to take its place — and that is more SVG than the landing page
 * should have to scroll past. Each mark takes its colour from a `--brand` custom
 * property so one rule in Landing.astro can mute them all and light them on hover.
